docs {
  # Delete Project

  Admin only, and irreversible: the Cloudinary asset is destroyed along with the
  document. `data` comes back as `null`.

  | Status | Meaning |
  | --- | --- |
  | 200 | deleted |
  | 401 | missing or expired token |
  | 404 | `NOT_FOUND` |
}
